[390.429979, "o", "PB-LLM: PARTIALLY B INARIZED L ARGE L ANGUAGE\r\nM ODELS\r\nYuzhang Shang∗\r\nIllinois Institute of Technology\r\n\r\nZhihang Yuan∗\r\nHuomo AI\r\n\r\nQiang Wu\r\nHuomo AI\r\n"]
[390.430259, "o", "\r\nZhen Dong\r\nUC Berkeley\r\n\r\narXiv:2310.00034v2 [cs.LG] 7 Nov 2023\r\n\r\nA BSTRACT\r\nThis paper explores network binarization, a radical form of quantization, compressing model weights to a single bit, specifically for Large Language Models (LLMs)\r\ncompression. Due to previous binarization methods collapsing LLMs, we propose\r\na novel approach, Partially-Binarized LLM (PB-LLM), which can achieve extreme\r\n"]
